    (136, "secret_list, secret_use and secret_save take person: the email of someone who wrote in this chat from the still.fail app."),
    (137, "In Antigravity CLI the station's tools that do not fit what it declares to you are reached through station_tool {name, arguments?}."),
    (138, "A vault item has an about now; secret_save requires about and secret_describe updates name or about."),
    (139, "feishu_api now saves non-JSON answers in this session's uploads and returns their local path, content_type and size."),
    (140, "Sessions no longer run in sandboxes, and job_start has no size any more. Heavy work goes to a sandbox via station_task."),
    (141, "New vault tools: secret_delete and secret_cancel."),
    (142, "New tool station_retire and skill stillfail-retire."),
    (143, "The station's tool descriptions are shorter; details moved to the skills they name."),
    (144, "A subagent you start must not post to the chat, end the turn, write to another chat's agent, open, leave or archive a chat, or write to Slack."),
    (145, "Retiring a station is switched off for now: station_retire start and hand_over are refused."),
    (146, "chat_create takes preset, fast and context."),
    (147, "The memory (MEMORY.md) and skills are now the same on every station of the workspace."),
    (148, "Messages and chat history now say sent_at or recorded_at in UTC."),
    (149, "station_list distinguishes unanswered from offline."),
    (150, "Memory holds lasting rules and facts only; condense overgrown files before adding to them."),
    (151, "card.assignee is the email in the from of the deciding person's message, never the runtime account email."),
    (152, "Reply briefly first when a request will take more than a couple of minutes; never register a new passkey unless asked."),
    (153, "A chat_post with no kind after all_done or need_human in the same turn means you go on."),
    (154, "stillfail-cron: set up in one turn; stillfail-vault: offer secret_save; stillfail-show: same size and data before/after."),
    (155, "Chat title says what the whole chat is for; decide by principle; read referenced chats from start; hand back devices once done."),
    (156, "New tool station_move and skill stillfail-move."),
